                <p class="snippet" >
                    119; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Hills, 2023 <b>SCC</b> 2; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Hamilton (2004), 72 O.R. (3d) 1; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Parranto, 2021 <b>SCC</b> 46, [2021] 3 S.C.R. 366; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Nasogaluak, 2010 <b>SCC</b> 6, [2010] 1 S.C.R. 206; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. K.R.J., <b>2016</b> <b>SCC</b> 31, [<b>2016</b>] 1 S.C.R. 906; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Lacasse, 2015 <b>SCC</b> 64, [2015] 3 S.C.R. 1089; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Ipeelee, 2012 <b>SCC</b> 13, [2012] 1 S.C.R. 433; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;593; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. McBeath, 2014 BCCA 305, 341 C.C.C. (3d) 531; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Boutilier, 2018 NSCA 65, 30 M.V.R. (7th) 31; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Morris, 2013 ONCA 223, 305 O.A.C. 47; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Campbell, 2017 ONSC 26; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Bonneteau, <b>2016</b> MBCA 72, 330 Man. <b>R</b>. (2d) 139; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. <b>Jordan</b>, <b>2016</b> <b>SCC</b> <b>27</b>, [<b>2016</b>] 1 S.C.R. 631; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. Askov, [1990] 2 S.C.R. 1199; <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;While Moldaver J.’s observations in <b>R</b>. <b>v</b>. <b>Jordan</b>, <b>2016</b> <b>SCC</b> <b>27</b>, [<b>2016</b>] 1 S.C.R. 631, relate to the impact of delays on s. 11(b) of the Canadian Charter of Rights and Freedoms, I find them apt in this context as well. 
                </p>
